{{feat
|type=class
|prereq=[[ranger]] 1
|desc=Rangers, when wearing [[light armor]], get all the benefits of having the [[ambidexterity]] and [[two-weapon fighting]] feats. While wearing [[medium armor|medium]] or [[heavy armor]] they lose these benefits.
|use=automatic
|icon=ife ambidex.gif
|class1=ranger
}}

==Notes==

* This feat does not qualify a character to take [[improved two-weapon fighting]] as a [[general feat]] selection. However, if nine levels of ranger are taken, ''improved two-weapon fighting'' will be granted automatically.
* Wearing robes or no armor qualifies as "wearing light armor" for the purposes of this feat.
* This feat serves only to inform the player; the benefits are hardcoded to the ranger class.